      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, for structs with `FreeMembers` function, we have an open issue regarding whether it should call `FreeMembers` or not depending on the user\u0027s use case. Fine to just use the C API for this case, but now that you have this, I think you probably need to call `GetFunctions().adapterInfoFreeMembers` at the end of this function to clean up the allocated members. Otherwise they are probably leaked.",
